<title>CHILE: TENNIS-CHILE LEADS PERU 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHILE LEADS PERU 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile lead Peru 2-0 in their</p>
<p>Davis Cup American zone group one play-off tie after winning</p>
<p>both singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Marcelo Rios beat Americo Venero 7-5 6-2 6-4.</p>
<p>Gabriel Silberstein beat Alejandro Aramburu 6-0 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
